# Normalize every text file to LF in the working tree.
#
# Prettier is configured with the default endOfLine: "lf", but with no
# .gitattributes a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true) received CRLF files,
# so `npm run format:check` failed locally with ~149 files while the Linux CI
# job passed. Pinning eol=lf keeps the working tree aligned with the committed
# blobs and with CI on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
